From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ophuscado <postbox@ophuscado.com>
Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 10:29:34 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 16/16] vulkan: q4_0 and q8_0 at 2-16 columns in ggml-metal's
 mul_mv_ext layout (GGML_VK_MMV_EXT)

The matrix-vector shaders split each row over the whole workgroup and keep one or two rows a workgroup, so every workgroup reads all of B again: 8 columns cost about 6x one column. mul_mat_vec_ext.comp splits a row over 8 invocations, takes 8 rows a workgroup of 64 and keeps every column's sum per invocation, as ggml-metal does.
---
 ggml/src/ggml-vulkan/ggml-vulkan.cpp          |  7 ++
 .../vulkan-shaders/mul_mat_vec_ext.comp       | 90 +++++++++++++++++++
 .../vulkan-shaders/vulkan-shaders-gen.cpp     |  3 +
 3 files changed, 100 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 ggml/src/ggml-vulkan/vulkan-shaders/mul_mat_vec_ext.comp

